    "answer": {
      "short": "$6\\pi\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\theta &= \\frac{2\\pi}{6}\\\\\\theta &= \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\\\A &= \\frac{1}{2}(6)^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)\\\\A &= 6\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
